                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly it's not worth it. I picked it up because it had dwarves and initially seemed fun, but game is abandoned in a poor state.\n\nTooltip fonts are tiny and unreadable, setting interface to x1.5 or x2 does not change anything, you still have unreadable text but bigger. The scaling affects pannels, on x1.5 or x2 they take almost half of the screen. Pathfinding is broken, you constantly need to repeat the command because some of the selected units will not go. Scenario maps are ridiculously large and you no clue where to go. The game keeps crashing.",
